  "id": "major-neurocognitive-disorder",
  "term": "major neurocognitive disorder",
  "definition": "Major neurocognitive disorder is a DSM-5 classification for severe cognitive decline that is documented in one or more cognitive areas and is serious enough to interfere with a person’s independence in everyday activities. In this framework, other possible causes or exclusionary conditions are also considered.",
